  "id": "wandering",
  "term": "wandering",
  "definition": "Wandering, in this packet’s sense of mind wandering, is a shift in thought away from the demands of a current purposeful activity. The thoughts involved are separate from ongoing task-related processing and may be unrelated to the task or independent of the current sensory input.",
